        <item>
            <id>https://lapin.ithome.com/html/digi/1001826.htm</id>
            <title>支持米家 + 小爱智控：Gosund 智能灯带 99 → 49 元刚需好价</title>
            <link>https://lapin.ithome.com/html/digi/1001826.htm</link>
            <guid isPermaLink="false">https://lapin.ithome.com/html/digi/1001826.htm</guid>
            <pubDate></pubDate>
            <updated>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 09:55:12 GMT</updated>
                
                
            <content:encoded>
                <![CDATA[
                    
                    <p><strong>如果淘金币不够，下方附借币方法。</strong></p><p>天猫【Gosund 旗舰店】</p><h2>智能灯带</h2><p>Gosund 智能灯带已接入米家，支持小爱语音控制，可色彩调节 + 音乐律动 + 智能联动，有 3C 认证。</p><p style="text-align: center;"><img height="362" src="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/a3511338-b043-450e-8579-791055806582.jpg?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto" title="支持米家 + 小爱智控：Gosund 智能灯带 99 → 49 元刚需好价" width="800" /></p><p>今日开启清仓狂促：</p><ul class=" list-paddingleft-2"><li><p>2 米版定价 99 元，今日券后 49.2 元。</p></li><li><p>5 米版定价 169 元，今日券后 93.2 元。</p></li></ul><p>灯带可每米自由裁剪长度，每个套装配备一个适配器。</p><dir><a contenteditable="false" href="https://uland.taobao.com/coupon/edetail?e=7bb2prRqo3SlhHvvyUNXZfh8CuWt5YH5OVuOuRD5gLJMmdsrkidbOWBzzpT26idJnYtwPttnaYWrTBntBr8g%2Bm4RVt1SmoUI2PcpnFsuV%2FCAn%2BWVu1CsI6iMnnU0dKkCRSHvQe2jOLZ9pbNCYX0I%2BPP%2BWUTgK%2F%2B0DI9LnV2RxzN7CtXivpqDNWonygWqoDk9008l46HZwgwcrN7D60fWEBHtR5M9fhgNtsfGA5CFJLDe4LCSMIu01HLmoMDXvnqU7jKjAO7pxYgdIMeVz1KiUedUUfszYWxCT4cMBL185VfcKzCdKorQ%2BVkl7%2BwGM1dPASNsMT5Bc9Gqe%2BSu%2F8jq%2BCUzVkkdwsIm&amp;traceId=213e047517892923888283288e0bf3&amp;&amp;union_lens=lensId:TAPI@1789292388@0b830dfc_141e_1a09a232210_c342@01" target="_blank"><span class="card main-site"><span class="card-logo"><img height="800" src="https://img.alicdn.com/i3/2200824632280/O1CN01DsIJHT1SiI3gFCCaQ_!!2200824632280.jpg" title="支持米家 + 小爱智控：Gosund 智能灯带 99 → 49 元刚需好价" width="800" /></span><span class="card-info"><span class="card-title"><span class="mall-data">天猫</span><span class="card-name"> Gosund 智能灯带</span></span><span class="card-abstract"> 2 米 / 5 米套装可选</span><span class="card-controls"><span class="price">折后 49 元起</span><span class="card-btn-deep">领 30 元券</span></span></span></span></a></dir><p>小米有品<strong>同款现售</strong> 1 米延长包 39 元，2 米套装大促价 89.9 元，5 米套装大促价 159 元：<a href="https://c.duomai.com/track.php?aid=4705&amp;dm_fid=16052&amp;euid=&amp;site_id=261624&amp;t=https%3a%2f%2fwww.xiaomiyoupin.com%2fdetail%3fgid%3d148336%26spmref%3dYouPinPC.%24SearchFilter%241.search_list.3.2058157%26last_